f things: Mat.5:11 12:35 15:19, Luk.6:22, 45, Jhn.3:19 7:7, Act.18:14 25:18, Gal.1:4, Col.1:21, 1Ti.6:4, 2Ti.4:18, Heb.3:12 10:22, Jas.2:4 4:16, 1Jn.3:12, II Jn 11, 3Jn.10; ὀφθαλμός (which see), Mat.6:23 20:15, Mrk.7:22, Luk.11:34; as subst., neut., τὸ π., Act.28:21, 1Th.5:22; opposite to ἀγαθόν, Luk.6:45, Rom.12:9; pl., Mat.9:4, Mrk.7:23, Luk.3:19.\n † SYN.: see: ἄθεσμος (AS)","source_line":4319}],"occurrence_count":78,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"maligno","count":16},{"gloss":"maus","count":15},{"gloss":"mau","count":10},{"gloss":"má","count":9},{"gloss":"mal","count":8},{"gloss":"más","count":5},{"gloss":"malignos","count":4},{"gloss":"piores","count":2},{"gloss":"maligna","count":2},{"gloss":"malicioso","count":1},{"gloss":"males","count":1},{"gloss":"maldades","count":1},{"gloss":"suspeitava","count":1},{"gloss":"reconciliou","count":1},{"gloss":"maldosas","count":1},{"gloss":"falando","count":1}]},"G5271":{"id":"G5271","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G5271","disambiguated_id":"G5271 =","unique_id":"G5271","headword":"ὑποκρίνω","transliteration":"hupokrinō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to pretend","definition_en":"ὑπο-κρίνομαι \n [in LXX: (Job.40:2) אּ1 (AB אּ2 ἀπο-, עָנָה), Sir.1:29 35:15 (32:15) Sir.36:2 (33:2), 2Ma.5:25 2Mac 6:21 2Mac 6:24, 4Ma.6:15 4Mac 6:17 * ;] \n__1. = Att.. ἀποκρίνομαι (which see), to answer, reply (Hom., Hdt., al.). \n __2. to answer on the stage, play apart (Arist., al.). Metaphorical, to feign, pretend (Demos., Polyb.): with accusative and inf., Luk.20:20 (cf. Ps sol 4:22).†\n (AS)","source_line":5427}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"que-fingiam","count":1}]},"G894":{"id":"G894","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0894","disambiguated_id":"G0894 =","unique_id":"G0894","headword":"ἄψινθος","transliteration":"apsinthos","lexical_morphology":"G:N-F","gloss_en":"wormwood","definition_en":"ἄψινθος, -ου, ἡ\n (also ἀψίνθιον, τό; ἀψινθία, ἡ), \nwormwood: as a proper name, 